<title>ZIMBABWE: Match our big hips, Zimbabwe women say.</title>
<headline>Match our big hips, Zimbabwe women say.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Zimbabwean women are angry with foreign manufacturers providing small-hipped dresses to Africa, saying the average black African woman has big hips and found them difficult to fit.</p>
<p>&quot;They make these straight things and we are expected to squeeze into them,&quot; one Patience Moyo told local state media.</p>
<p>Zimbabwean clothing makers say they are aware of &quot;this fact&quot;.</p>
</text>
